flowchart TD
    accTitle: Scene state and render handoff
    accDescr: Shared scene culling uses retained instances and storage, then calls a concrete scene renderer with geometry and lighting inputs.
    Node[VisualInstance3D and resources] -->|server updates| Instance[RendererSceneCull instances]
    Instance -->|references| Storage[Mesh material light and particle storage]
    VP[RendererViewport] -->|render camera| Cull[Scene visibility and preparation]
    Instance --> Cull
    Storage -->|bounds and metadata| Cull
    Cull -->|geometry shadow and GI inputs| Interface[RendererSceneRender]
    Interface -->|RD base and clustered policy| Plus[RenderForwardClustered]
    Interface -->|RD base and mobile policy| Mobile[RenderForwardMobile]
    Interface -->|GL policy| GL[RasterizerSceneGLES3]
    Plus -->|record| RD[RenderingDevice]
    Mobile -->|record| RD
    GL -->|issue| OpenGL[GL commands]
